824	{"artifactId":"ISSUE-6dbf14435972af7a","entry":{"id":"16524022","text":"Root-cause precision: the exclusion of extension and amendment records from the pending list is deliberate today. src/workflow/pending.ts:36-41 (PENDING_KINDS) says: \"EXTEND / STUB / AMD stay excluded — they are not artifacts a reviewer approves in the review panel.\" In practice the stakeholder approves them (AMD-c2ba6fa62a148ed1-8, -9, -10 and the s13 extension on 2026-10-17, through approveAmendmentById and insrc_workflow_approve), so the fix reverses that recorded decision; the design should say so and decide how a JSON-only amendment is shown in the pane.","actor":{"id":"legacy:controller-2026-10-17","kind":"person","properties":{"name":"controller (2026-10-17)"}},"timestamp":"2026-10-17T16:28:34.102Z","feedback":[],"kind":"comment"}}
